{
  "info": {
    "name": "Multi-Service Bookings API",
    "_postman_id": "multi-service-bookings-collection",
    "description": "End-to-end test suite for the multi-service booking feature.\n\nCovers ONLY the changes introduced by this branch:\n- `GET /bookings/availability` now takes `serviceIds` (array) and returns `services[]` + `totalDurationMinutes`. Slot availability accounts for consecutive-slot blocks.\n- `POST /bookings/preview` and `POST /bookings/confirm` now take `services: [{ barberServiceId, bookingType }]` (max 4). Each service carries its own bookingType so blocks can span regular + after-hours.\n- `GET /client/bookings/:id` now returns a `services[]` array with per-service pricing.\n- `GET /client/barbers/:barberId/recurring-slots` takes `serviceIds` (array) and enforces the combined block fits.\n- `POST /client/recurring-bookings` takes `services: [...]`; `recurring_booking_services` children are written.\n\n## Required test data\nBefore running, pick (or create) TWO active `barber_services` rows for your barber that both have:\n- `regular_price_usd` set\n- `recurring_price_usd` set (for the recurring tests)\n\nOptionally: a third service with `after_hours_price_usd` set (for the boundary-crossing test).\n\nIdeal barber schedule for Tuesday (dayOfWeek=2):\n- `regular_start_time = 09:00`, `regular_end_time = 17:00`, `slot_duration_minutes = 30`, `is_working = true`\n- `after_hours_enabled = true`, `after_hours_start = 17:00`, `after_hours_end = 20:00`\n- `recurring_enabled = true`, `recurring_frequency = weekly`\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `barberEmail` / `barberPassword` / `clientEmail` / `clientPassword` collection variables.\n2. Run the **1. Auth** folder in order — tokens and ids auto-populate.\n3. Run **2. Prep** once — captures `serviceAId` + `serviceBId` from the barber's active services.\n4. Run the test folders in order. Each folder's happy-path items must run before its edge cases that depend on state (e.g. Confirm must run before Overlap).\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Set by |\n|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | Collection variable (default http://localhost:3001) |\n| `barberToken` / `clientToken` | Login scripts |\n| `barberId` / `clientId` | Login scripts |\n| `serviceAId` / `serviceBId` / `serviceAfterHoursId` | Prep — first/second/third active services |\n| `bookingDate` | Prep — next Tuesday in YYYY-MM-DD |\n| `createdBookingId` | Confirm (happy) |\n| `recurringId` | Recurring Create (happy) |\n\n## Notes\n- All tests assume `dayOfWeek = 2` (Tuesday). Change `dayOfWeek` + `bookingDate` together if needed.\n- The boundary-crossing test (regular→after_hours) is skipped unless `serviceAfterHoursId` is set and the schedule has both windows configured.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "barberEmail", "value": "barber@example.com" },
    { "key": "barberPassword", "value": "YourPassword123!" },
    { "key": "clientEmail", "value": "client@example.com" },
    { "key": "clientPassword", "value": "YourPassword123!" },
    { "key": "barberToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "clientToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "barberId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "clientId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "serviceAId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "serviceBId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "serviceAfterHoursId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "dayOfWeek", "value": "2" },
    { "key": "bookingDate", "value": "" },
    { "key": "slotTime", "value": "10:00" },
    { "key": "boundarySlotTime", "value": "16:30" },
    { "key": "createdBookingId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "recurringId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[AUTH] Login as Barber",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('accessToken returned', () => pm.expect(json.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('barberToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('barberId', json.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{barberEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{barberPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"barber\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[AUTH] Login as Client",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('accessToken returned', () => pm.expect(json.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('clientToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('clientId', json.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{clientEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{clientPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"client\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Prep",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[PREP] Capture 2 active services + compute next Tuesday",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const services = (json.services || []).filter(s => s.isActive !== false);",
                  "pm.test('has at least 2 active services', () => pm.expect(services.length).to.be.gte(2));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceAId', services[0].id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceBId', services[1].id);",
                  "",
                  "// Find next matching dayOfWeek in YYYY-MM-DD",
                  "const dow = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('dayOfWeek'));",
                  "const today = new Date();",
                  "const delta = (dow - today.getDay() + 7) % 7 || 7;",
                  "const target = new Date(today.getTime() + delta * 86400000);",
                  "const y = target.getFullYear();",
                  "const m = String(target.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');",
                  "const d = String(target.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('bookingDate', `${y}-${m}-${d}`);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{barberToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/barber/services",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["barber", "services"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Availability",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[AVAIL] 1 service — happy path (backwards compat)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('services[] length 1', () => pm.expect(json.services).to.have.lengthOf(1));",
                  "pm.test('totalDurationMinutes equals the single service', () => pm.expect(json.totalDurationMinutes).to.equal(json.services[0].durationMinutes));",
                  "pm.test('days[] is not empty', () => pm.expect(json.days.length).to.be.greaterThan(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/barbers/{{barberId}}/availability?serviceIds={{serviceAId}}&startDate={{bookingDate}}&endDate={{bookingDate}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["barbers", "{{barberId}}", "availability"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "serviceIds", "value": "{{serviceAId}}" },
                { "key": "startDate", "value": "{{bookingDate}}" },
                { "key": "endDate", "value": "{{bookingDate}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[AVAIL] 2 services — happy path",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('services[] length 2', () => pm.expect(json.services).to.have.lengthOf(2));",
                  "pm.test('totalDurationMinutes = sum of durations', () => pm.expect(json.totalDurationMinutes).to.equal(json.services[0].durationMinutes + json.services[1].durationMinutes));",
                  "",
                  "// Price per slot should be sum of service regular prices",
                  "const day = json.days.find(d => d.slots.regular.length > 0);",
                  "if (day) {",
                  "  const expected = json.services[0].regularPrice + json.services[1].regularPrice;",
                  "  const slotPrice = day.slots.regular[0].price;",
                  "  pm.test('slot price == sum of service regular prices', () => pm.expect(slotPrice).to.be.closeTo(expected, 0.01));",
                  "  pm.test('slot.endTime - slot.time equals totalDuration', () => {",
                  "    const toMin = t => { const [h, m] = t.split(':').map(Number); return h * 60 + m; };",
                  "    pm.expect(toMin(day.slots.regular[0].endTime) - toMin(day.slots.regular[0].time)).to.equal(json.totalDurationMinutes);",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/barbers/{{barberId}}/availability?serviceIds={{serviceAId}},{{serviceBId}}&startDate={{bookingDate}}&endDate={{bookingDate}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["barbers", "{{barberId}}", "availability"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "serviceIds", "value": "{{serviceAId}},{{serviceBId}}" },
                { "key": "startDate", "value": "{{bookingDate}}" },
                { "key": "endDate", "value": "{{bookingDate}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[AVAIL] end-of-window trimming (2 services)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const day = json.days.find(d => d.slots.regular.length > 0);",
                  "if (day) {",
                  "  const lastSlot = day.slots.regular[day.slots.regular.length - 1];",
                  "  const toMin = t => { const [h, m] = t.split(':').map(Number); return h * 60 + m; };",
                  "  // lastSlot.endTime must be inside the working window — the block must fit",
                  "  pm.test('last emitted slot has room for the full block', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(toMin(lastSlot.endTime) - toMin(lastSlot.time)).to.equal(json.totalDurationMinutes);",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/barbers/{{barberId}}/availability?serviceIds={{serviceAId}},{{serviceBId}}&startDate={{bookingDate}}&endDate={{bookingDate}}",
